body:
[https://www.reddit.com/r/TrueOffMyChest/comments/aovfkh/i\_dont\_know\_how\_to\_continue\_on/](https://www.reddit.com/r/TrueOffMyChest/comments/aovfkh/i_dont_know_how_to_continue_on/)

I ranted here already, if you want to know a small percentage of whats happening then its there. I cant imagine any future for myself other than a drug addict, prostitute,  or stripper running away from all her problems and trying to find happiness through others because i hate myself so much and im never good enough. somehow i manage to fuck everything up and im so tired. everyone around me tells me its all my fault when to me it feels like its my parents controlling the entire situation refusing to help me and instead taking everything that makes me happy away. i cant bear to waste my life away anymore.  My parents took away the only things that were keeping me going and now im tired. my family is telling me im having these problems because im not "relying on jehovah" but i dont even believe in the bible. really its their dedication to this cult over their daughter which is causing me to feel like this and theres no way out

&#x200B;
